          "content": "三、不确定项选择题(每题2分，共20分)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.143,
            0.496,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": "1、组成染色质非组蛋白的特征是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.165,
            0.289,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": "A.酸性蛋白"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.165,
            0.567,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": "B.数量少、种类多"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.187,
            0.414,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "C. 维持染色质的高级结构"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.187,
            0.736,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "D. 调节遗传信息的表达与复制"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.231,
            0.468,
            0.249
          ],
          "content": "2、有关核被膜的描述正确的是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.253,
            0.31,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": "A. 双层膜结构"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.381,
            0.253,
            0.783,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": "B.两层核膜之间的腔隙与粗面内质网腔相通"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.275,
            0.414,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": "C. 是真核细胞的重要标志"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.432,
            0.275,
            0.71,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": "D.内外核膜上均有核糖体附着"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.319,
            0.479,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": "3、具有9+0结构的细胞骨架有"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.342,
            0.247,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "A.鞭毛"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.354,
            0.342,
            0.421,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "B.纤毛"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.363,
            0.267,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "C. 中心体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.363,
            0.363,
            0.431,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "D. 基体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.407,
            0.595,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": "4、下列哪几种膜性细胞器属于细胞内膜系统"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.429,
            0.247,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": "A.核膜"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.354,
            0.43,
            0.441,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": "B.溶酶体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.451,
            0.267,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "C. 线粒体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.363,
            0.451,
            0.473,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "D.运输小泡"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.495,
            0.603,
            0.513
          ],
          "content": "5、下列哪一些叙述符合化学渗透假说的观点:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.517,
            0.394,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "A. 递氢体具有氢泵作用"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.428,
            0.517,
            0.714,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "B. $\\mathrm{H}^{+}$ 不能自由通过线粒体内膜"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.539,
            0.55,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": "C. 线粒体内膜外测的  $\\left[H^{+}\\right]$  比内膜内侧低"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.561,
            0.641,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": "D. 线粒体膜两侧的电位差是合成 ATP 的能量基础。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.606,
            0.456,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": "6、光面内质网的主要功能是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.627,
            0.289,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": "A. 解毒作用"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.375,
            0.628,
            0.505,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": "B.糖原的合成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.649,
            0.309,
            0.667
          ],
          "content": "C. 脂类的合成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.649,
            0.515,
            0.667
          ],
          "content": "D.糖脂的合成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.693,
            0.371,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": "7、细胞生长表现为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.715,
            0.352,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": "A. 细胞大小的增加"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.407,
            0.715,
            0.578,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": "B.细胞干重的增加"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
